# Build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile.* is the repository root, because
# the Go service modules reach backend, contracts and migrations through
# relative `replace` directives, and the web images need the pnpm workspace.
#
# The point of this file is not just a smaller context: a host-built
# node_modules copied into a linux image is the classic "works on my machine"
# -- the binaries in it were compiled for the host platform.

# Never in an image: secrets.
.env
.env.*
*.local

# Installed or generated by the host, rebuilt inside the image. `dist/` matters
# twice over: leaving it in would let a stale build ship as the new one.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.umi
**/.umi-production
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS and editor state.
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.omc
.DS_Store

# Not needed to build anything, and the docs are large.
docs
miniapp
**/*.md
